The flag shown in the image is the national flag of the Netherlands. The flag features horizontal stripes of red, white, and blue, with a red disc (known as the "Wilhelmina rose") in the top left corner (the hoist side) on a white stripe. This flag is commonly flown by the Dutch Navy, and naval ships from the Netherlands would display this flag.

