- ��福同 (nán fú tóng): This part is a bit less straightforward but can be translated as "South Blessing Same" or "Together with South Blessing".

Putting it all together, a possible translation could be "Abundant Goods, South Blessing Together" or "Rich Products, Same with South Blessing". The exact meaning might depend on the specific context in which it is used, but it generally suggests a place where a variety of goods are available, possibly with a focus on items from the south or associated with good fortune.

